  "details": {
   "description": "Introducing the new Henko Matic Liquid - your machine wash specialist. Its bio-stain power removes even the toughest of stains in the machine, and nano-fibre lock technology fights ageing in clothes by locking the fibres and preventing them from breaking & damaging. Henko Matic Liquid's ultra colour care protects your clothes from fading and maintains the colour & shine of your clothes even after up to 20 washes. This revolutionary liquid detergent has 99.9% germ protection which ensures your family is protected from harmful germs after-wash. Henko Matic Liquid's enhanced formulation ensures complete care not just for your clothes but for your washing machine too. Henko Matic Liquid is effective in high water levels (20 litres) of front-load washing machines and completely dissolves ensuring no residue in your machine or your clothes.",
